  "notes": "Boot a Family Guy S.A.M. ROM from an empty NVRAM and enter the Single Lamp Test with the named service keys (Back, Select x3 reach the diagnostics menu with SW highlighted, Plus x3 moves to LAMP, Select opens the lamp menu, Select starts the Single Lamp Test with ONE highlighted). 80 further Plus presses step the ROM's own lamp selector (the first press displays lamp 2), so every lamp name and wire colour on the display is paired with the public lamp addresses that changed during that 1 s interval. The scenario names no game."
